{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Werestadt, a small country on the frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eleanor, the daughter of the Count of Vale who governs a land rich in nature, learns the secrets of her birth on her 18th birthday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's not a human, but a princess of the distant fae that are only mentioned in fairy tales nowadays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When told that she's placed under the care of the count looking after the fairy forest until the ruined fairy realm is revived, she is shaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm not a human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm not related by blood to my family members who are important to me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eleanor is troubled by the new reality, but with new meetings, she'll forge a path to the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The agreed deadline has come. Let's go home, my fellow kin.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will Eleanor choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player, you assume the role of the protagonist and help her to choose her destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring joy to her beloved and the numerous people around her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time: 5 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1212780?t=1772802240","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212780/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772802240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772802240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1212780/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772802240","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,5,4],"notes":"This work contains elements 